Due to limited resources, we’re not able to feature both Sylvester and Leonora every single time in external art and other media, but we’ll do our best to keep their appearances as balanced as possible.

在游戏外的各种艺术媒体，出于资源限制，我们无法保证每一次都兼顾 Sylvester 和 Leonora ，但我们会尽力保持两人平衡的出场机会。

@everyone
